# Code Owners
# These owners are automatically requested for review on PRs.
# Last person listed takes precedence for overlapping paths.
#
# Replace @your-org/your-team with a real team before relying on this. A handle that is
# not a collaborator on the repo is silently ignored, so a wrong entry reads as "reviewed
# by nobody" rather than as an error.

# Default: all files
* @your-org/your-team

# Design system — extra care needed, changes affect the whole app
apps/expo/constants/tokens.ts @your-org/your-team
packages/shared/tokens.css @your-org/your-team

# CI/CD changes need explicit review
.github/ @your-org/your-team
